  "description": "Official LuciferCore framework: A high-performance, fully asynchronous .NET ecosystem built on Data-Oriented Design (DOD). Featuring a lock-free Buffer-Model architecture designed to saturate multi-core hardware for massive throughput. Automating infrastructure so you can focus 100% on core logic.",
